  m_Name: Extension_ArtificialWonderParticipation_Era1_Oracle
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Title: The Oracle
  Description: "Through the ecstatic visions of its priestess, the Pythia, the Oracle
    offered counsel to all who sought it. Pilgrims filled the roads to her sanctuary,
    and around it life reorganized: fields yielded more, workshops hummed, coin changed
    hands, and knowledge gathered. A city that held the Oracle knew a rare calm \u2014
    whatever the question, there was an answer."
